@*
    Lucide icons (ISC licensed, https://lucide.dev), inlined rather than loaded as
    <img> so `currentColor` and the shared `.icon` rule in app.css can drive both
    colour and size. The source SVGs live in wwwroot/brand/icons — when a new icon
    is needed, copy it in there and add a case below rather than pulling in a
    second icon family.

    Icons here are decorative: every use sits next to a text label, so they are
    marked aria-hidden and the label carries the accessible name.
*@

<svg class="icon @Class" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">@((MarkupString)Paths)</svg>

